@startuml
title DNAT - Etapa 5
caption Mesmo com falha na VM executora, os dados sensiveis continuam contidos na VM principal

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #14324A
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam roundcorner 18
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #355C7D
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 140

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4B6584
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  BorderColor #D4B85F
  FontColor #5C4813
}
skinparam rectangle<<mainvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  BorderColor #2F6FB5
  FontColor #113A63
}
skinparam rectangle<<risk>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF1F1
  BorderColor #C73E1D
  FontColor #7A1E13
}
skinparam rectangle<<microvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF2
  BorderColor #C0A000
  FontColor #6E5A00
}
skinparam database<<secret>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8ECFF
  BorderColor #5B6EE1
  FontColor #263A99
}
skinparam database<<storage>> {
  BackgroundColor #F3F7FB
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
  FontColor #294A70
}

rectangle "CVM principal" <<mainvm>> as MAIN {
  component "Frontend + API" as FE
  component "IPFS + Marketplace" as APP
  database "Dados sensiveis\nwallet, chaves,\nblobs e datasets" <<secret>> as SEC
}

rectangle "CVM executora\ncomprometida" <<risk>> as EXEC {
  component "API de execucao" as API
  rectangle "microVM executora" <<microvm>> as M
  database "Saidas temporarias" <<storage>> as OUT
}

FE --> API : envia apenas bundle efemero
M --> OUT : grava resultado
OUT --> API : retorno local
API -[#C73E1D,dashed,thickness=2]-> SEC : tentativa de exfiltracao

note on link #FFF7D6
bloqueada pela separacao arquitetural
end note

note bottom of MAIN
Os dados sensiveis permanecem na VM principal.
A executora nao guarda chaves, wallet, IPFS nem o acervo completo.
end note

@enduml
